    "html": "<div style=\"width: 1728px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; color: #1B2440; background: #FFFEFB\">\n<div style=\"width: 864px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-right: 1px dashed #B8BCC6\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; padding: 80px 80px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Welcome</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.1; color: #16306E\">Thank you for trusting us with your care</h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; color: #C8231E; width: 36px; flex: none; line-height: 1.2\">1</p><p style=\"margin: 0; flex: 1; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.45\"><b>Evaluation.</b> Your specialist examines your painful joint or area (knee, hip, shoulder, back or other) and reviews your history and imaging.</p></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; color: #C8231E; width: 36px; flex: none; line-height: 1.2\">2</p><p style=\"margin: 0; flex: 1; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.45\"><b>Your plan.</b> We explain every option, including benefits, risks and alternatives.</p></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; color: #C8231E; width: 36px; flex: none; line-height: 1.2\">3</p><p style=\"margin: 0; flex: 1; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.45\"><b>Follow-up.</b> We check in after treatment and track how you're doing.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height: 384px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; padding: 48px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-radius: 0 40px 0 0\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px\">Your care team</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"width: 336px; height: 192px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 2px dashed #8FA2CC; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 16px; color: #D9E1F2\">[BUSINESS CARD SLITS]</div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; flex: 1; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #D9E1F2\">Your physician: ______________<br><br>Next visit: ______________</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 864px; height: 1152px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; padding: 80px 80px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.15; color: #16306E\">Questions to ask your specialist</h2>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.45\">\n<li>Am I a good candidate, and why?</li>\n<li>What are the risks and possible side effects?</li>\n<li>What other treatments could I try?</li>\n<li>How soon can I return to normal activity?</li>\n<li>What will my insurance cover, and what will I pay?</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A5568\">Notes: ______________________________________________</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height: 384px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #F7F6F2; border-top: 6px solid #C8231E; padding: 48px 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; border-radius: 40px 0 0 0\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px; color: #16306E\">Forms and instructions</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5\">Keep your consent forms, prep instructions and after-care sheet here.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5\">Questions about billing? Call [BILLING LINE].</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A5568\">Individual results vary. Not every patient is a candidate for every procedure.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
